Hey guys!

I just uploaded some location concept art for TJD3 here on Steam, [url=http://steamcommunity.com/app/220090/images/?p=1&browsefilter=mostrecent]in TJD1's artwork section[/url]. Please check it out and give us your thoughts! Remember that these are works in progress and that these locations may not even wind up being a part of the game. 

Development of TJD3 is moving along real nicely, if you wanna follow our progress, check out www.skygoblin.com and our twitters:

@theowaern
@henrik_englund
@mathias_json

Stay rad! :)

/theo

